<title>USA: Duke, Suburban set marketing.</title>
<headline>Duke, Suburban set marketing.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Energy Trading and Marketing said Tuesday it has finalized a reciprocal marketing agreement with Suburban Propane Partners LP to offer customers of both the convenience of one-stop shopping for propane and natural gas.</p>
<p>In this commission-based agreement, Duke Energy will sell propane on behalf of Suburban, and Suburban will market Duke Energy's natural gas to its current and prospective customers, the Duke Energy Corp subsidiary said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
